    "start_line": 4,
    "end_line": 8,
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": "This policy establishes the standards governing the evaluation, eligibility, and acceptance of collateral for secured financing within the Capital Markets Lending Desk. It ensures alignment with regulatory expectations, internal credit risk frameworks, and enterprise-wide collateral management standards. The policy aims to maintain high-quality collateral pools, protect the institution from counterparty default, and promote consistent decision-making."
  },
  {
    "id": "p1_b3_fc0646bf",
    "page": 1,
    "block_num": 3,
    "start_line": 10,
    "end_line": 10,
    "type": "heading",
    "content": "2. Scope",
    "level": 2
  },
  {
    "id": "p1_b4_3bdc6c3a",
    "page": 1,
    "block_num": 4,
    "start_line": 12,
    "end_line": 16,
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": "This policy applies to all secured financing transactions originated, renewed, or amended by the Capital Markets Lending Desk. It covers all client types\u2014including financial institutions, corporates, and asset managers\u2014across the U.S. and Canada. Exclusions include retail lending, margin lending administered by the Prime Brokerage unit, and collateral processes governed by bilateral derivative agreements."
  },
  {
    "id": "p1_b5_4e9c9767",
    "page": 1,
    "block_num": 5,
    "start_line": 18,
    "end_line": 18,
    "type": "heading",
    "content": "3. Policy Requirements",
    "level": 2
  },
  {
    "id": "p1_b6_d41d8cd9",
    "page": 1,
    "block_num": 6,
    "start_line": 20,
    "end_line": 28,
    "type": "bulleted_list",
    "content": "",
    "items": [
      {
        "content": "All collateral must meet eligibility criteria defined by Credit Risk Management."
      },
      {
        "content": "Collateral must be independently valued using approved pricing sources."
      },
      {
        "content": "Haircuts must follow enterprise-approved schedules and be applied consistently."
      },
      {
        "content": "Legal enforceability must be validated through internal or external counsel prior to transaction onboarding."
      },
      {
        "content": "Concentration limits, wrong-way risk controls, and re-hypothecation restrictions must be adhered to."
      },
      {
        "content": "Documentation must include collateral schedules, valuation statements, and legal opinions."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "p1_b7_7f34d1a0",
    "page": 1,
    "block_num": 7,
    "start_line": 30,
    "end_line": 30,
